# Project Documentation

## Café Reverie – Sales & Marketing System

This folder contains the documentation for the Café Reverie Sales & Marketing System.

### Project Report

The complete project report contains:

* Project introduction and objectives
* System functionality
* User and administrator features
* Technology stack
* Database design
* System operations
* Project conclusion

### Technology Stack

The system was developed using:

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript
* PHP
* MySQL
* SQL

### Main System Areas

The application consists of:

* Customer-facing pages
* User registration and login
* Product browsing
* Customer reviews and comments
* Help Desk
* Administrator dashboard
* Product and inventory management
* Review management
* User management

### Database

The project uses a MySQL database named `cafe`, containing tables for users, comments, and products.

